{"last_link_id": 2, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [488.5942687988281, 681.4228515625], "pos": [860, 0], "widgets_values": ["Topaz4K"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 2, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "id": 901, "type": "SaveImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.67", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["① 原图\n· 短边 1080 的图选 2x → 正好 4K\n· 720 的图要 3 倍，见说明卡"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [340, 190], "pos": [-420, 0], "id": 910, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["④ 出片：前缀 = Topaz4K"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [340, 120], "pos": [860, 700], "id": 912, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [1], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [354.1294250488281, 664.7434692382812], "pos": [0, 0], "widgets_values": ["f8b2f85a311862823c9d8cb159554f05f235e48e79fd7514a9f4aaee0ec82cc0.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "id": 902, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.67", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# 图片 4K 保真放大（Topaz High Fidelity + 人脸增强）\n\n**给短边 720 / 1080 的图做 2 倍放大到 4K，同时修小脸。**\n链路：原图 → Topaz 高保真模型放大（带人脸增强）→ 出片。一次一张图。\n\n**怎么用（按左边 ①②③ 顺序）**\n\n1. **① 原图** —— 传 png / jpg / webp。\n2. **② 放大倍率** —— `2x` 是给 1080 短边的源（1080 → 2160，正好 4K）；\n   720 短边的源想要 4K（2160）需要 3 倍，如果下拉里只有 2x/4x：\n   选 **4x** 出 2880 再缩到 2160（超采样，反而更干净），或者先 2x 到 1440 再用别的工具补。\n3. **③ 人脸增强强度** —— 默认 **0.8**；脸特别小、特别糊可以试 0.9~1.0，\n   脸本来清楚就降到 0.5（避免\"修过头不像本人\"）。\n4. **④ 出片文件名前缀** —— 默认 Topaz4K。\n\n**为什么用这一档**\n\n* `HighFidelityV2` 是 Topaz 的**保真档**：优先保持原貌、少发明细节；\n  源片本身就是 720/1080（不是垃圾画质）时，它比\"低清档\"更合适；\n* 它的**人脸增强**是单独一段模型：只针对检测到的人脸重建，\n  所以\"小脸很糊\"能救，而背景不会被一起重画；\n* 如果源片更差（短边 < 500、压缩噪点很重），把节点换成\n  `RH_TopazlabsImageUpscaleLowResolutionV2`（低清专用档）。\n\n**注意**\n\n* 这是**平台 API 节点**，跑一次会消耗平台额度，注意成本；\n* 人脸增强强度越高越\"清晰\"，但越高越像\"另一个人\"，交付前放大看一眼脸；\n* 想更省事：先只放大不修脸（强度 0 或关掉人脸增强）看一版，再加人脸增强对比。\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [1170.8902587890625, 394.4619140625], "pos": [1.2234230041503906, -522.9489135742188], "id": 913, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [2], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["2x", "All", true, 1, 1, false, 1851380854, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 1, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "scale"}, "name": "scale", "label": "scale", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "scale"}, {"widget": {"name": "subjectDetection"}, "shape": 7, "name": "subjectDetection", "label": "subjectDetection", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "subjectDetection"}, {"widget": {"name": "faceEnhancement"}, "shape": 7, "name": "faceEnhancement", "label": "faceEnhancement", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "faceEnhancement"}, {"widget": {"name": "faceEnhancementCreativity"}, "shape": 7, "name": "faceEnhancementCreativity", "label": "faceEnhancementCreativity", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "faceEnhancementCreativity"}, {"widget": {"name": "faceEnhancementStrength"}, "shape": 7, "name": "faceEnhancementStrength", "label": "faceEnhancementStrength", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "faceEnhancementStrength"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_TopazlabsImageUpscaleHighFidelityV2", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [337.9820251464844, 266], "pos": [440, 60], "id": 900, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"scale": true, "faceEnhancementStrength": true}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_TopazlabsImageUpscaleHighFidelityV2"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["② 放大倍率（scale）\n③ 人脸增强强度（0.8）\n人脸增强开关 / 创意度已固定（开 / 0）"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [336.0712890625, 143.218994140625], "pos": [440, 420], "id": 911, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [135.12067787400906, 145.01397897660598], "scale": 1.0610764609500007}}, "groups": [], "links": [[1, 902, 0, 900, 0, "IMAGE"], [2, 900, 0, 901, 0, "IMAGE"]], "id": "5e3a8cfb-30b6-4794-99ac-d8973c37